    "_doc": "Fresh-context strategy agent: spawned when NEXT runs low, every cadence_units accepted units, on a declination, at a plateau (plateau.units units or plateau.wall_clock_hours of SUPERVISED time without an accepted result), after a REFUTED verdict, or after a promotion (configs/RECOMMENDED.json changed between loop tops). Writes ONLY strategy artifacts (results/queue.json + a journal strategy note). model / claude_effort apply only to Claude; codex_model / codex_reasoning_effort apply only to Codex. A blank model or effort inherits that harness's configured default.",
