    "_doc": "No accepted result in this many units OR this much SUPERVISED wall-clock (time the driver was actually running, persisted in results/queue.json across launches - an outage between launches is not a plateau), whichever trips first (dual-denominated: 5 units is a fine plateau test at 1 s/unit and a two-week blind spot at 24 h/unit).",
